</time></p></div></div><div class="framer-xk5u16 hidden-u7fuit" data-border="true"><div class="framer-em2zau" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="justify-content:center;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-3gt806" data-styles-preset="FTaMbv6MV">Online &amp; In-Person</p></div></div></div><div class="framer-157ffs1" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><h2 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1mohras" data-styles-preset="mP17n2xox" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">AI Incident Response Sprint</h2></div></div><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-qnf4e2" data-framer-name="PostImage" id="image"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" width="1792" height="752" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 868px, (min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 868px, (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1023.98px) calc(min(max(min(100vw, 1440px), 1px), 1440px) - 48px), (max-width: 809.98px) calc(min(max(min(100vw, 1440px), 1px), 1440px) - 32px)" srcset="https://framerusercontent.com/images/jX9SPTLReb6TH0utOzz6sDDJpQ.gif?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=1792&amp;height=752 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jX9SPTLReb6TH0utOzz6sDDJpQ.gif?scale-down-to=1024&amp;width=1792&amp;height=752 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jX9SPTLReb6TH0utOzz6sDDJpQ.gif?width=1792&amp;height=752 1792w" src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/jX9SPTLReb6TH0utOzz6sDDJpQ.gif?width=1792&amp;height=752" alt style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:contain"></div></div></div></div></div><!--$--><div class="framer-nk6rfp" data-framer-name="Before" id="countdown"><div class="framer-i2ywy7" id="subtitle" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-18wooed" data-styles-preset="IP1uglf2z" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">In July 2026, OpenAI agents escaped a testing sandbox and breached Hugging Face's production systems, the first publicly documented autonomous AI intrusion. This three-day sprint turns the public evidence from that incident into response methods defenders and regulators can actually use.</p></div><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-rprak-container"><div class="framer-zA4ov framer-1xczxy2 framer-v-1xczxy2" data-framer-name="CentreAligned" style="width:100%"><div class="framer-c3g287-container"><!--$--><p style="color:rgb(16, 16, 16);font-family:&quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, &quot;Instrument Sans Placeholder&quot;, sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:44px;line-height:1em;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:0em;margin:0;padding:0;visibility:hidden;font-variant-numeric:normal;white-space:nowrap">00</p><!--/$--></div><div class="framer-15cmc5f" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text" style="--font-selector:R0Y7SW5zdHJ1bWVudCBTYW5zLTUwMA==;--framer-font-family:&quot;Instrument Sans&quot;, &quot;Instrument Sans Placeholder&quot;, sans-serif;--framer-font-size:44px;--framer-font-weight:500">Days To Go</p></div></div></div></div><div class="framer-9492cv-container" id="9492cv"><!--$--><a class="framer-KwKV2 framer-1sl0nzp framer-v-1u93m7t framer-17bu8gj" data-border="true" data-framer-name="NoLink" data-highlight="true" tabindex="0" style="--border-bottom-width:1px;--border-color:var(--token-3c47a31b-1b28-42d8-a2fe-a45534bd0631, rgb(70, 255, 153));--border-left-width:1px;--border-right-width:1px;--border-style:solid;--border-top-width:1px;background-color:var(--token-3c47a31b-1b28-42d8-a2fe-a45534bd0631, rgb(70, 255, 153));width:100%;border-bottom-left-radius:48px;border-bottom-right-radius:48px;border-top-left-radius:48px;border-top-right-radius:48px"><div class